Appendix A-യിലെ hidden-drop ഏഴ് grind recurrence-കളും SAVE-യും ഒരൊറ്റ loop-ൽ പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 modulus-lock fixture. ആരംഭ x=M ആണ്; grind g-ൽ synthetic stone value M-g ആകുന്നതിനാൽ ഓരോ update-നും result വീണ്ടും M തന്നെയാകണം.

Hamlet, M സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, ഇപ്പോഴത്തെ hidden value സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, grind number സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, ഇപ്പോഴത്തെ synthetic stone value സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, pending raw/SAVE value സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, flow-വും assignment-വും സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, M നിർമ്മിക്കാൻ ശേഷിക്കുന്ന doubling count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: M നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: ഒന്നിൽ നിന്ന് 2 power 127 minus 1 വരെ.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Miranda]

Scene II: 127 doublings.
Hamlet:
 Are you better than nothing?
Miranda:
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Hamlet:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Miranda:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene III: M-ന്റെ അവസാന minus one.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: ഏഴ് hidden grinds.

Scene I: x=M, grind=1.
[Enter Hamlet and Juliet]
Hamlet:
 You are as good as Hamlet.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.

Scene II: ഏഴ് grind-ുകളും തീർന്നോ എന്ന് നോക്കുന്നു.
Romeo:
 Am I better than the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero?
Prospero:
 If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.

Scene III: ഈ grind-ന്റെ stone=M-g.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Othello]
Hamlet:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and Romeo.

Scene IV: x squared plus 3x plus stone plus grind.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Juliet and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 Are you worse than nothing?
Macbeth:
 If so, let us proceed to scene V.
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us proceed to scene VI.

Scene V: negative Euclidean remainder repair.
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.

Scene VI: pending value commit ചെയ്ത് output ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Juliet]
Macbeth:
 You are as good as Macbeth.
 Open your heart.

Scene VII: grind number കൂട്ടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene VIII: ഏഴ് grinds പൂർത്തിയായി.
[Exeunt]
